Inputs: 4 provided tab-separated raw-count tables; 7,127 unique shared gene IDs per table.
Sample order/design: changed = SRR5085169, SRR5085170; reference = SRR5085167, SRR5085168.
Prefilter: retain rowSums(counts >= 10) >= 2 across the four raw-count samples; retained 2,526 genes.
Method: DESeq2 1.46.0 (R 4.4.3), design ~condition, reference baseline, Wald contrast changed-reference; unshrunken coefficient; independentFiltering=FALSE and cooksCutoff=FALSE; BH correction over the 2,526 retained p-values.
Validation: differential_expression.tsv has the exact four requested columns and 2,526 data rows; IDs match the retained input universe exactly; all log2 fold changes are finite and p_value/fdr values are in [0,1].
